VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2114, 'Tom Clancy''s The Division', 'Tom Clancy''s The Division', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1yvf.jpg', NULL, 'Tom Clancy’s The Division is a revolutionary experience that combines robust RPG customization with tactical action combat. There’s never been a better time to jump in and join the fight to save NYC.

Join other agents to combat the outbreak in Manhattan across a wide-range of story missions and open-world activities.

Enter the Dark Zone to earn high-level gear and face off against other players. Just be sure to watch your back.

Customize your agent, get cutting-edge gear, build a unique arsenal to gain an edge on Manhattan’s deadliest inhabitants.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/tom-clancy-s-the-division', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 10.01, '2026-10-17 22:32:03', '2026-10-17 22:32:03')
