VALUES (100088, 'tt3581920', NULL, 'The Last of Us', 'The Last of Us', 'tv', 2023, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmo6TYuuJgaYinXBPjrgG9mB5od.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lY2DhbA7Hy44fAKddr06UrXWWaQ.jpg', 'Twenty years after modern civilization has been destroyed, Joel, a hardened survivor, is hired to smuggle Ellie, a 14-year-old girl, out of an oppressive quarantine zone. What starts as a small job soon becomes a brutal, heartbreaking journey, as they both must traverse the United States and depend on each other for survival.', NULL, NULL, 49.8023, 8.413, 0, 1.72269230769230752e+01, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-10-17 22:32:03')
