VALUES (157845, 'tt2345737', NULL, 'The Rover', 'The Rover', 'movie', 2014, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/734OOkr69mt8lyPk8iw3TwgQ90R.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXI4ljoRVDBp2vHRoXKb2jPlmAj.jpg', 'Ten years after a severe economic collapse in the western world, lawlessness reigns and life is cheap. Eric is a lone drifter, and his car is his only possession. When a gang steals it, Eric comes across the injured Rey, left behind by the car thieves. The pair form an unlikely and uneasy alliance.', NULL, NULL, 8.19, 6.26, 0, 9.03666666666666706e+00, '2026-07-30 18:28:39', '2026-10-17 22:32:03')
